  "text_md": "# 4 STAFF RESOURCES\n\n10 Please provide the following personnel statistics for the current year and the two previous years.\n\n|Annual manpower|Year before past year||Past year||Current year||Period average||\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n|Permanent staff 12 13 Other staff|Overall|Relevant fields¹¹|Overall|Relevant fields 11|Overall|Relevant fields¹¹|Overall|Relevant fields¹¹|\n|Total|||||||||\n|Permanent staff as a proportion of total staff (%)|%|%|%|%|%|%|% %||\n\n10 If this tender is submitted by a consortium, the data in the table above must be the sum of the data in the corresponding tables in the declarations provided by the consortium members — see point 7 of this tender form. Consolidated data are not requested for financial ratios. 11 Corresponding to the relevant specialisms identified in point 5 below. Staff directly employed by the tenderer on a permanent basis (i.e. under indefinite contracts). Other staff not directly employed by the tenderer on a permanent basis (i.e. under fixed-term contracts).\n\n**August 2020** Page 1 of 9 c4l_tenderform_en.doc\n",
